Join us to train AI that understands the physical world and can design what comes next. Coding agents have succeeded partly because of objective, fast, and cheap RL environments, but it's often overlooked that there's no big expertise gap between AI researchers and software engineers. An AI researcher can easily assess correctness and coding strategies.

In science, it is important to bridge the gap by seeking brilliant individuals who go deep and pay attention to the details, enabling the creation of systems that otherwise would not exist.

@DBahdanau: "At @periodiclabs we are looking for brilliant new colleagues who excel at bridging AI and science. The role's main focus is advanced evals and training data/tasks, but you will also be involved in internal science and AI work. Apply or spread the word!"

